    "title": "Zoey Stark Talks Wrestlers Farting Mid-Match - 'We All Have Buttholes' - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Thomas Lowson ,\n29 minutes ago\nFormer WWE Superstar Zoey Serrano has admitted to passing wind while competing in the ring, adding that several wrestlers let it rip mid-match.\nSpeaking in a video from her new ‘Zoey 101’ series, Serrano was first asked if she had soiled herself while competing in the ring. She said,\n“No, thank goodness. I personally have never had that issue. I have heard many, many stories where people do soil themselves.”\nREAD MORE: Gail Kim Gail Kim Calls Out Reporter BJ Bethel for ‘Made-Up’ AEW Claims After ESPN Controversy\nREAD MORE: Nancy Huber, Mother Of Jon ‘Brodie Lee’ Huber, Dead\nSerrano added that she’s never peed herself during a match either, though did admit that she may have ‘tooted’ while wrestling. She said,\n“I have tooted in the ring. I have passed gas. It happens. You’re doing a lot of exerting, a lot of pushing.\n“If someone lands on you or you’re picking up someone who maybe didn’t get up the right way, or whatever the case may be, it’s a natural thing, guys. It happens. We all fart. We all have buttholes. Get over it.”\nSerrano, fka Zoey Stark, was cut from WWE while recovering from an injury suffered during a match for WWE. Her non-compete clause has since expired.",
    "summary": "Former WWE Superstar Zoey Serrano has admitted to passing wind while competing in the ring, adding that several wrestlers let it rip mid-match. Speaking in a video from her new ‘Zoey 101’ series, Serrano was first asked if she had soiled herself while competing in the ring.",
